      "title": "INTRODUCTION",
      "kind": "intro",
      "page": 0,
      "text_preview": "C REDIT CARDS have become an indispensable part of our lives. As with all technologies, improvements can be made to make the use of the credit card more convenient to the consumer. Magnetic stripe technology, used today, allows only one application, using a relatively small number of bits, to be placed onto a single plastic card. Magnetic stripes suffer short lifetimes due to wear. The closely cou ..."
