    {
      "number": "VI",
      "title": "SUMMARY",
      "kind": "conclusion",
      "page": 5,
      "text_preview": "This IC demonstrates that low cost and good performance can coexist and is enabled by system-on-a-chip technology. Measured performance of a receiver that provides excellent BER performance in the presence of digital switching noise has been presented. An isolation circuit that provides a measured improvement in protection against noninvasive power analysis attack has been introduced. ACKNOWLEDGEM ..."
